      "worked": "The altitude bisects the base, and each vertex angle is $60^\\circ$.\n$$\\begin{align*}h^2&=2^2-1^2\\\\h&=\\sqrt{3}\\\\A_{\\text{triangle}}&=\\frac12\\times2\\times\\sqrt{3}\\\\A_{\\text{triangle}}&=\\sqrt{3}\\\\A_{\\text{sectors}}&=3\\times\\frac{60}{360}\\pi(1)^2\\\\A_{\\text{sectors}}&=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\A_{\\text{gap}}&=\\sqrt{3}-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
